{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_014tokqHLv8WXS88AxszuMVT","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tnarrative_guidance: 核心 finding (phase-dependent severity) 跨 GPQA 稳健复现，dose-response\n2\t  单调递增 (ρ=1.0)。但 strategy specificity magnitude 从 MATH-500 的 15-17× 衰减至 GPQA 的 2-5×（与\n3\t  GSM8K 同量级），确认 specificity 强度是 task-dependent 而非 universal constant。需将论文 C1 claim\n4\t  拆分为 (a) phase gradient universality (strong, fully supported across 3 benchmarks)\n5\t  和 (b) strategy specificity magnitude (qualified, context-dependent)。\n6\timagined_experiments:\n7\t- name: GPQA DeepSeek Importance s020\n8\t  plan_id: gpqa_ds_importance_s020\n9\t  description: DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B importance masking at s=0.20 on GPQA-Diamond\n10\t    (n≈198), measuring per-problem paired phase gradient\n11\t  expected_results:\n12\t    n_problems: 198\n13\t    high_phase_median_ii: 0.038\n14\t    mid_phase_median_ii: 0.285\n15\t    low_phase_median_ii: 1.98\n16\t    median_difference: 1.94\n17\t    median_difference_ci:\n18\t    - 1.72\n19\t    - 2.21\n20\t    wilcoxon_p: 2.5e-28\n21\t    cohens_dz: 0.72\n22\t    gradient_monotonic: true\n23\t    perplexity_high_both: 2.85\n24\t    perplexity_mid_both: 7.9\n25\t    perplexity_low_both: 42.3\n26\t  result_rationale: 在 median 档位下，GPQA importance phase gradient 延续 s015 的强单调趋势。s015\n27\t    已观测到 median_diff=0.947，s020 按 sub-exponential growth（约 2× 增长因子）预期达到 ~1.9。GPQA\n28\t    推理链更长（平均 ~6000 tokens vs MATH-500 ~1200），低 sparsity phase 累积更多 compound interaction，但每\n29\t    segment 平均 II 可能略低于 MATH-500（因 GPQA 推理步骤更多样化，非纯数学计算）。效应量 d_z≈0.72 介于 s015 的 ~0.55\n30\t    和 MATH-500 s020 的 0.73 之间，反映 GPQA 的高方差样本特性。\n31\t  tables:\n32\t  - name: Phase-stratified II statistics (GPQA s020)\n33\t    columns:\n34\t    - phase\n35\t    - n_segments\n36\t    - n_tokens\n37\t    - ii_median\n38\t    - ii_mean\n39\t    - ii_ci_low\n40\t    - ii_ci_high\n41\t    rows:\n42\t    - - high\n43\t      - 6261\n44\t      - 479658\n45\t      - 0.038\n46\t      - 0.42\n47\t      - 0.12\n48\t      - 0.95\n49\t    - - mid\n50\t      - 2185\n51\t      - 276409\n52\t      - 0.285\n53\t      - 1.85\n54\t      - 1.42\n55\t      - 2.35\n56\t    - - low\n57\t      - 5128\n58\t      - 465085\n59\t      - 1.98\n60\t      - 12.4\n61\t      - 10.6\n62\t      - 14.5\n63\t  figures_description:\n64\t  - 'Fig: Per-problem paired difference distribution (n=198), showing right-skewed\n65\t    positive distribution with 85%+ problems having positive low-high difference'\n66\t  analysis: Phase gradient 在 s020 显著（Bonferroni-corrected p < 0.001），与 MATH-500 和\n67\t    GSM8K 的 s020 级别定性一致。效应量大于 GSM8K-DS s020 (0.740 median_diff) 但基于 GPQA 更长的推理链和更多\n68\t    segment 采样，统计功效充分。\n69\t- name: GPQA DeepSeek Importance s025\n70\t  plan_id: gpqa_ds_importance_s025\n71\t  description: DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B importance masking at s=0.25 on GPQA-Diamond\n72\t    (n≈198)\n73\t  expected_results:\n74\t    n_problems: 198\n75\t    high_phase_median_ii: 0.095\n76\t    mid_phase_median_ii: 0.72\n77\t    low_phase_median_ii: 3.65\n78\t    median_difference: 3.55\n79\t    median_difference_ci:\n80\t    - 3.05\n81\t    - 4.15\n82\t    wilcoxon_p: 8.2e-34\n83\t    cohens_dz: 0.88\n84\t    gradient_monotonic: true\n85\t    perplexity_high_both: 4.2\n86\t    perplexity_mid_both: 18.5\n87\t    perplexity_low_both: 78.6\n88\t  result_rationale: s025 是 compound interaction 显著增强的关键拐点。在 MATH-500 上 s025 median_diff=3.99，在\n89\t    median 档位下 GPQA 应与 MATH-500 数值相近但略低（~3.55），因为：(1) GPQA 问题推理路径更长但每步 reasoning 深度更浅（多为知识检索+逻辑连接而非深层数学变换），导致\n90\t    per-segment compound interaction 稍弱；(2) GPQA 的 perplexity landscape 更平坦（知识检索 token\n91\t    的 baseline perplexity 较高），discrimination collapse 的相对影响略减。增长因子从 s015→s020 的 2×\n92\t    降至 s020→s025 的 1.8×，符合 sub-exponential 预期。\n93\t  tables:\n94\t  - name: Phase-stratified II statistics (GPQA s025)\n95\t    columns:\n96\t    - phase\n97\t    - n_segments\n98\t    - n_tokens\n99\t    - ii_median\n100\t    - ii_mean\n101\t    - ii_ci_low\n102\t    - ii_ci_high\n103\t    rows:\n104\t    - - high\n105\t      - 6261\n106\t      - 479658\n107\t      - 0.095\n108\t      - 0.88\n109\t      - 0.42\n110\t      - 1.52\n111\t    - - mid\n112\t      - 2185\n113\t      - 276409\n114\t      - 0.72\n115\t      - 5.6\n116\t      - 4.1\n117\t      - 7.8\n118\t    - - low\n119\t      - 5128\n120\t      - 465085\n121\t      - 3.65\n122\t      - 28.5\n123\t      - 22.8\n124\t      - 35.2\n125\t  figures_description:\n126\t  - 'Fig: Dose-response curve comparing GPQA vs MATH-500 vs GSM8K importance median_diff\n127\t    across s015-s025 (3 points), showing parallel monotonic trends with GPQA intermediate\n128\t    between GSM8K and MATH-500'\n129\t  analysis: s025 效应量（d_z≈0.88）进入 large 区间，GPQA gradient 在量级上接近但略低于 MATH-500（3.55 vs\n130\t    3.99），这与 median 档位预期一致——GPQA 的 phase gradient 存在但 specificity magnitude 不如纯数学\n131\t    benchmark。\n132\t- name: GPQA DeepSeek Importance s030\n133\t  plan_id: gpqa_ds_importance_s030\n134\t  description: DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B importance masking at s=0.30 on GPQA-Diamond\n135\t    (n≈198), 关键指标实验\n136\t  expected_results:\n137\t    n_problems: 198\n138\t    high_phase_median_ii: 0.18\n139\t    mid_phase_median_ii: 1.45\n140\t    low_phase_median_ii: 5.05\n141\t    median_difference: 4.87\n142\t    median_difference_ci:\n143\t    - 3.82\n144\t    - 5.95\n145\t    wilcoxon_p: 3.1e-36\n146\t    cohens_dz: 0.95\n147\t    gradient_monotonic: true\n148\t    dose_response_spearman_rho: 1.0\n149\t    perplexity_high_both: 5.8\n150\t    perplexity_mid_both: 32.5\n151\t    perplexity_low_both: 145.2\n152\t    low_high_ratio: 28.1\n153\t  result_rationale: median 档位核心约束：gpqa_imp_median_diff_s030 ∈ [3.0, 6.0]。预测 4.87 落在区间中部。理由：(1)\n154\t    GPQA 推理链长度（~6000 tokens）意味着 low-sparsity phase 有大量 segment 累积 compound damage，但\n155\t    GPQA 问题的 reasoning chain 不如 MATH-500 的逐步推导那样对 intermediate attention pattern 敏感——GPQA\n156\t    更多依赖知识检索和因果推理，而非精确数值操作。(2) 从 s025→s030 增长因子约 1.4×（从 3.55 到 4.87），延续 sub-exponential\n157\t    递减趋势（MATH-500 同区间增长因子 2.1×）。(3) 效应量 d_z≈0.95 接近 MATH-500 的 1.13 但未达到，因 GPQA 的\n158\t    per-problem variance 更高（问题难度跨度大）。(4) 全 4 级 sparsity 构成完美单调序列（rho=1.0），确认 dose-response\n159\t    在 GPQA 上成立。\n160\t  tables:\n161\t  - name: GPQA 4-level dose-response summary\n162\t    columns:\n163\t    - sparsity\n164\t    - median_diff\n165\t    - ci_low\n166\t    - ci_high\n167\t    - cohens_dz\n168\t    - wilcoxon_p\n169\t    rows:\n170\t    - - s015\n171\t      - 0.947\n172\t      - 0.88\n173\t      - 1.03\n174\t      - 0.55\n175\t      - 1.4e-29\n176\t    - - s020\n177\t      - 1.94\n178\t      - 1.72\n179\t      - 2.21\n180\t      - 0.72\n181\t      - 2.5e-28\n182\t    - - s025\n183\t      - 3.55\n184\t      - 3.05\n185\t      - 4.15\n186\t      - 0.88\n187\t      - 8.2e-34\n188\t    - - s030\n189\t      - 4.87\n190\t      - 3.82\n191\t      - 5.95\n192\t      - 0.95\n193\t      - 3.1e-36\n194\t  - name: Cross-benchmark comparison at s030\n195\t    columns:\n196\t    - benchmark\n197\t    - imp_median_diff_s030\n198\t    - growth_factor_s025_s030\n199\t    rows:\n200\t    - - MATH-500\n201\t      - 8.48\n202\t      - 2.13\n203\t    - - GPQA\n204\t      - 4.87\n205\t      - 1.37\n206\t    - - GSM8K\n207\t      - 4.68\n208\t      - 2.35\n209\t  figures_description:\n210\t  - 'Fig: 三 benchmark dose-response 曲线对比（MATH-500 / GPQA / GSM8K），x=sparsity level,\n211\t    y=importance median_diff，显示三者均单调递增但 slope 不同'\n212\t  - 'Fig: GPQA per-problem paired difference 分布 at s030，boxplot + violin，90%+ problems\n213\t    positive'\n214\t  analysis: GPQA s030 median_diff=4.87 确认 phase gradient 跨 benchmark 稳健。值得注意的是 GPQA\n215\t    数值介于 GSM8K(4.68) 和 MATH-500(8.48) 之间，暗示 gradient magnitude 与 reasoning chain complexity\n216\t    非简单线性关系——GPQA 链最长但 gradient 非最大。这可能因为 GPQA 的长链中包含更多'低复杂度'检索 segment，稀释了 per-token\n217\t    compound interaction 的影响。此发现支持 Discussion 中'specificity 与 reasoning depth/type\n218\t    关系'的开放问题。\n219\t- name: GPQA DeepSeek Random s020\n220\t  plan_id: gpqa_ds_random_s020\n221\t  description: DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B random masking at s=0.20 on GPQA-Diamond\n222\t    (n≈198), 用于计算 imp/rand ratio\n223\t  expected_results:\n224\t    n_problems: 198\n225\t    high_phase_median_ii: 0.022\n226\t    mid_phase_median_ii: 0.13\n227\t    low_phase_median_ii: 0.72\n228\t    median_difference: 0.7\n229\t    median_difference_ci:\n230\t    - 0.38\n231\t    - 1.05\n232\t    wilcoxon_p: 0.0035\n233\t    cohens_dz: 0.22\n234\t    gradient_monotonic: true\n235\t    imp_rand_ratio_s020: 2.77\n236\t    perplexity_high_both: 6.2\n237\t    perplexity_mid_both: 8.5\n238\t    perplexity_low_both: 15.8\n239\t  result_rationale: median 档位核心约束：gpqa_imp_rand_ratio ∈ [2.0, 5.0]。预测 ratio=2.77（importance\n240\t    s020 median_diff 1.94 / random s020 median_diff 0.70）。理由：(1) 在 MATH-500 上 DeepSeek\n241\t    random s020 NS（median_diff≈-0.016），但在 LLaMA 上 random 所有条件显著（d_z=0.41-0.46）——GPQA\n242\t    更长的推理链提供更多 statistical power 和更多 low-sparsity segment 让 random masking 的 compound\n243\t    effect 也能积累到可检测水平。(2) GSM8K imp/rand ratio 为 2.3-3.8×，GPQA 在 median 档位应与此一致（因为两者的\n244\t    reasoning chain 长度更接近，都远长于 MATH-500 的短链）。(3) Random 的 phase gradient 存在但效应量小（d_z=0.22,\n245\t    small），与 LLaMA 上观测到的 random gradient 行为一致——进一步确认 strategy specificity 不是 all-or-nothing\n246\t    而是 magnitude difference。(4) 这意味着 reviewers 的质疑成立：GPQA 上 random 也有显著 gradient，只是弱\n247\t    2-3×，需要将'importance-specific'的 framing 改为'importance-dominant but not exclusive'。\n248\t  tables:\n249\t  - name: GPQA Strategy comparison at s020\n250\t    columns:\n251\t    - strategy\n252\t    - median_diff\n253\t    - cohens_dz\n254\t    - p_value\n255\t    - significant\n256\t    rows:\n257\t    - - importance\n258\t      - 1.94\n259\t      - 0.72\n260\t      - 2.5e-28\n261\t      - true\n262\t    - - random\n263\t      - 0.7\n264\t      - 0.22\n265\t      - 0.0035\n266\t      - true\n267\t    - - ratio\n268\t      - 2.77\n269\t      - '-'\n270\t      - '-'\n271\t      - '-'\n272\t  - name: Cross-benchmark imp/rand ratio comparison\n273\t    columns:\n274\t    - benchmark\n275\t    - ratio_range\n276\t    - random_significant_at_s020\n277\t    rows:\n278\t    - - MATH-500 (DS)\n279\t      - 15-17×\n280\t      - No (NS)\n281\t    - - GSM8K (DS)\n282\t      - 2.3-3.8×\n283\t      - Marginal\n284\t    - - GPQA (DS)\n285\t      - 2.5-3.5×\n286\t      - Yes (p<0.005)\n287\t    - - LLaMA cross-arch\n288\t      - 2.0-2.6×\n289\t      - Yes (all conditions)\n290\t  figures_description:\n291\t  - 'Fig: GPQA importance vs random phase gradient 对比 bar chart，显示两者均为正但 importance\n292\t    ~3× 更强'\n293\t  - 'Fig: Strategy specificity ratio 跨 benchmark 汇总图，showing MATH-500 outlier (15-17×)\n294\t    vs GPQA/GSM8K/LLaMA cluster (2-5×)'\n295\t  analysis: GPQA random s020 显著（p<0.005）且 gradient 方向与 importance 一致，但效应量仅为 importance\n296\t    的 1/3。这与 LLaMA cross-arch 结果（ratio 2.0-2.6×）和 GSM8K（2.3-3.8×）高度一致，强化了'MATH-500\n297\t    的 15-17× ratio 是 outlier 而非 norm'的结论。Strategy specificity 成为 established pattern\n298\t    (task-dependent) 而非 isolated anomaly——具体来说，需要短推理链 + 高精度数学计算 + Qwen2 架构才能产生极端 ratio。这要求论文将\n299\t    C1 claim 拆分并加 qualifier：phase gradient universality (strong) vs specificity magnitude\n300\t    (qualified, driven by task×architecture interaction)。\n301\t- name: GPQA Cross-benchmark Gradient Correlation\n302\t  plan_id: gpqa_cross_benchmark_correlation\n303\t  description: 计算 GPQA importance gradient 与 MATH-500/GSM8K gradient 的跨 benchmark\n304\t    相关性\n305\t  expected_results:\n306\t    spearman_rho_gpqa_vs_math500: 1.0\n307\t    spearman_rho_gpqa_vs_gsm8k: 1.0\n308\t    cross_benchmark_gradient_correlation: 0.92\n309\t    gradient_slope_ratio_gpqa_vs_math500: 0.57\n310\t    gradient_slope_ratio_gpqa_vs_gsm8k: 1.04\n311\t  result_rationale: median 档位约束 cross_benchmark_gradient_correlation ∈ [0.85, 0.95]。预测\n312\t    0.92：三个 benchmark 的 4-level dose-response 均为完美单调（Spearman ρ=1.0 each），但 absolute\n313\t    magnitude 和 growth rate 不同。Pearson correlation on log-scale gradient magnitudes\n314\t    给出 0.92（低于 1.0 因为 growth factor 的 benchmark-specific 差异：MATH-500 growth 3.8→4.8→2.1，GPQA\n315\t    growth 2.0→1.8→1.4，GSM8K growth 3.1→2.7→2.4）。这意味着 phase gradient 的定性模式（方向+单调性）完全\n316\t    universal，但定量曲线形状 task-dependent——sufficient for 'phase gradient universality'\n317\t    strong claim，但 slope/curvature 需加 qualifier。\n318\t  tables:\n319\t  - name: 4-level gradient comparison across benchmarks (DeepSeek importance)\n320\t    columns:\n321\t    - sparsity\n322\t    - MATH-500\n323\t    - GPQA\n324\t    - GSM8K\n325\t    rows:\n326\t    - - s015\n327\t      - 0.39\n328\t      - 0.947\n329\t      - 0.241\n330\t    - - s020\n331\t      - 1.21\n332\t      - 1.94\n333\t      - 0.74\n334\t    - - s025\n335\t      - 3.99\n336\t      - 3.55\n337\t      - 1.992\n338\t    - - s030\n339\t      - 8.48\n340\t      - 4.87\n341\t      - 4.682\n342\t  - name: Growth factors between adjacent levels\n343\t    columns:\n344\t    - transition\n345\t    - MATH-500\n346\t    - GPQA\n347\t    - GSM8K\n348\t    rows:\n349\t    - - s015→s020\n350\t      - 3.1×\n351\t      - 2.0×\n352\t      - 3.1×\n353\t    - - s020→s025\n354\t      - 3.3×\n355\t      - 1.8×\n356\t      - 2.7×\n357\t    - - s025→s030\n358\t      - 2.1×\n359\t      - 1.4×\n360\t      - 2.4×\n361\t  figures_description:\n362\t  - 'Fig: Three-panel dose-response with shared y-axis (log scale), showing parallel\n363\t    but non-identical curves; MATH-500 steepest, GPQA flattest at high sparsity'\n364\t  analysis: 跨 benchmark 相关性 0.92 支持 phase gradient universality 的 strong claim。但 GPQA\n365\t    的 sub-exponential decay 明显快于 MATH-500（s025→s030 仅 1.4× vs 2.1×），暗示 GPQA 的 reasoning\n366\t    在 extreme sparsity 下可能已接近 ceiling effect（compound interaction 饱和），而 MATH-500 的精确计算链仍有空间进一步恶化。\n367\t- name: GPQA Strategy Specificity Summary (projected)\n368\t  plan_id: gpqa_strategy_specificity\n369\t  description: 汇总 GPQA 上 importance vs random 的 phase gradient 差异，计算 imp/rand ratio\n370\t    跨 sparsity levels\n371\t  expected_results:\n372\t    imp_rand_ratio_s015: 3.2\n373\t    imp_rand_ratio_s020: 2.8\n374\t    imp_rand_ratio_s025: 3.5\n375\t    imp_rand_ratio_s030: 2.9\n376\t    mean_imp_rand_ratio: 3.1\n377\t    random_significant_fraction: 0.75\n378\t    strategy_x_phase_interaction_p: 0.008\n379\t  result_rationale: median 档位约束 gpqa_imp_rand_ratio ∈ [2.0, 5.0]。预测 mean ratio=3.1，落在区间中下部。理由：(1)\n380\t    GPQA 长推理链给 random masking 更多机会累积 compound effect，缩小与 importance 的差距；(2) ratio\n381\t    跨 sparsity level 相对稳定（2.8-3.5）而非随 sparsity 增大而扩大（这与 MATH-500 不同，后者 ratio 从 s015\n382\t    的 28× 到 s030 的 17× 虽在缩小但始终极端）；(3) random 在多数条件下显著（3/4 significant after Bonferroni），与\n383\t    LLaMA 行为模式一致而非 MATH-500-DeepSeek 的 random-NS 模式。(4) Strategy×phase 交互仍显著（p<0.01）但\n384\t    F 值远小于 MATH-500 的版本，Reviewers 会接受 interaction 存在但要求 magnitude 相关 claims 加 qualifier。\n385\t  tables:\n386\t  - name: GPQA imp/rand ratio by sparsity level\n387\t    columns:\n388\t    - sparsity\n389\t    - imp_median_diff\n390\t    - rand_median_diff\n391\t    - ratio\n392\t    - rand_significant\n393\t    rows:\n394\t    - - s015\n395\t      - 0.947\n396\t      - 0.3\n397\t      - 3.2\n398\t      - marginal (p=0.04)\n399\t    - - s020\n400\t      - 1.94\n401\t      - 0.7\n402\t      - 2.8\n403\t      - yes (p=0.004)\n404\t    - - s025\n405\t      - 3.55\n406\t      - 1.01\n407\t      - 3.5\n408\t      - yes (p<0.001)\n409\t    - - s030\n410\t      - 4.87\n411\t      - 1.68\n412\t      - 2.9\n413\t      - yes (p<0.001)\n414\t  - name: Strategy specificity across all benchmarks\n415\t    columns:\n416\t    - benchmark\n417\t    - mean_ratio\n418\t    - ratio_range\n419\t    - pattern\n420\t    rows:\n421\t    - - MATH-500 (DS n=500)\n422\t      - 22.4\n423\t      - 15.5-38.6×\n424\t      - random NS at s015/s020; extreme separation\n425\t    - - GSM8K (DS n=50)\n426\t      - 2.9\n427\t      - 2.3-3.8×\n428\t      - random gradient exists but weaker\n429\t    - - GPQA (DS n=198)\n430\t      - 3.1\n431\t      - 2.8-3.5×\n432\t      - random mostly significant; moderate separation\n433\t    - - LLaMA cross-arch (n=250)\n434\t      - 2.3\n435\t      - 2.0-2.6×\n436\t      - random all significant; minimal separation\n437\t  figures_description:\n438\t  - 'Fig: Heatmap of imp/rand ratios (rows=benchmark, cols=sparsity), color-coded\n439\t    to show MATH-500 as clear outlier'\n440\t  - 'Fig: Forest plot of strategy×phase interaction effect sizes across benchmarks/architectures'\n441\t  analysis: GPQA ratio 3.1 与 GSM8K (2.9) 和 LLaMA (2.3) 形成 cluster，远离 MATH-500 (22.4)\n442\t    的离群值。这确立了'strategy specificity magnitude is task-dependent'作为 robust pattern 而非\n443\t    isolated observation。Reviewers 会认可 phase gradient universality 但要求将 specificity\n444\t    claim 降调。Discussion 需新增段落分析 possible mechanism：MATH-500 的极端 ratio 可能源于数学计算的 attention\n445\t    pattern 高度结构化（特定 head 专注于操作数关系），使 importance eviction 造成的 discrimination collapse\n446\t    影响远大于 random 的 uniform damage；而 GPQA/GSM8K 的推理更多依赖分布式知识表示，两种 eviction 造成的损伤更均匀。\n447\t- name: Expected Reviewer Scores (median tier)\n448\t  plan_id: reviewer_score_projection\n449\t  description: 基于 GPQA 结果和完整证据链预测 reviewer 评分\n450\t  expected_results:\n451\t    reviewer_1_score: 3.5\n452\t    reviewer_2_score: 3.0\n453\t    reviewer_3_score: 3.5\n454\t    average_score: 3.33\n455\t    novelty_score: 3.25\n456\t    soundness_score: 3.5\n457\t    significance_score: 3.0\n458\t    clarity_score: 3.5\n459\t  result_rationale: median 档位约束 expected_reviewer_avg_score ∈ [3.0, 3.5], novelty_score\n460\t    ∈ [3.0, 3.5]。Reviewer 1（方法论专家）给 3.5：认可 recency control 的 experimental design contribution\n461\t    和 triple dissociation 的清晰性，但对 7B-only scale 有轻微保留。Reviewer 2（efficiency/systems\n462\t    方向）给 3.0：认可 finding 的 empirical rigor 但质疑'so what'——phase gradient 的 practical\n463\t    implication 不够清晰，C5b mitigation pilot 失败削弱了 impact story。Reviewer 3（NLP/reasoning\n464\t    方向）给 3.5：对 cross-benchmark 分析和 task-dependent specificity 的 open question framing\n465\t    表示欣赏，认为这为 future work 打开了有意义的方向。共同关注点：(a) specificity claim 需要 qualifier（全部三人），(b)\n466\t    7B scale limitation（2/3），(c) architecture dependence 需更多讨论（1/3）。\n467\t  tables:\n468\t  - name: Projected reviewer feedback summary\n469\t    columns:\n470\t    - aspect\n471\t    - consensus\n472\t    - dissent\n473\t    rows:\n474\t    - - phase gradient universality\n475\t      - accepted (strong evidence)\n476\t      - none\n477\t    - - strategy specificity magnitude\n478\t      - requires qualifier\n479\t      - R2 wants this demoted to secondary finding\n480\t    - - recency control novelty\n481\t      - recognized as contribution\n482\t      - R2 questions if methodological innovation warrants inclusion\n483\t    - - 7B scale limitation\n484\t      - acknowledged in limitations\n485\t      - R1 suggests at least one 13B+ data point\n486\t    - - architecture dependence\n487\t      - interesting open question\n488\t      - R3 wants more mechanistic speculation\n489\t  figures_description: []\n490\t  analysis: Average 3.33 is borderline accept at EMNLP。关键 rebuttal 策略：(1) 强调 phase\n491\t    gradient universality 的 unprecedented evidence breadth (3 benchmarks × 3 architectures\n492\t    × 4 sparsity levels)；(2) 主动承认 specificity is task-dependent 并 frame 为 positive\n493\t    contribution（发现了影响 specificity 的 factors，不是 limitation 而是 nuanced understanding）；(3)\n494\t    对 R2 的 practical impact concern，指向 recency control 作为 future phase-aware system\n495\t    design 的基础。\n496\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e8046c84-5cd4-464b-93af-2206790a119d","uuid":"5a280f65-3481-4f87-a9df-a01d72d0b4c4","timestamp":"2026-05-17T03:58:21.572Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_11/projects/phase-gated-compound-sparse/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260517T032843/median/review_context.yaml","content":"narrative_guidance: 核心 finding (phase-dependent severity) 跨 GPQA 稳健复现，dose-response\n  单调递增 (ρ=1.0)。但 strategy specificity magnitude 从 MATH-500 的 15-17× 衰减至 GPQA 的 2-5×（与\n  GSM8K 同量级），确认 specificity 强度是 task-dependent 而非 universal constant。需将论文 C1 claim\n  拆分为 (a) phase gradient universality (strong, fully supported across 3 benchmarks)\n  和 (b) strategy specificity magnitude (qualified, context-dependent)。\nimagined_experiments:\n- name: GPQA DeepSeek Importance s020\n  plan_id: gpqa_ds_importance_s020\n  description: DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B importance masking at s=0.20 on GPQA-Diamond\n    (n≈198), measuring per-problem paired phase gradient\n  expected_results:\n    n_problems: 198\n    high_phase_median_ii: 0.038\n    mid_phase_median_ii: 0.285\n    low_phase_median_ii: 1.98\n    median_difference: 1.94\n    median_difference_ci:\n    - 1.72\n    - 2.21\n    wilcoxon_p: 2.5e-28\n    cohens_dz: 0.72\n    gradient_monotonic: true\n    perplexity_high_both: 2.85\n    perplexity_mid_both: 7.9\n    perplexity_low_both: 42.3\n  result_rationale: 在 median 档位下，GPQA importance phase gradient 延续 s015 的强单调趋势。s015\n    已观测到 median_diff=0.947，s020 按 sub-exponential growth（约 2× 增长因子）预期达到 ~1.9。GPQA\n    推理链更长（平均 ~6000 tokens vs MATH-500 ~1200），低 sparsity phase 累积更多 compound interaction，但每\n    segment 平均 II 可能略低于 MATH-500（因 GPQA 推理步骤更多样化，非纯数学计算）。效应量 d_z≈0.72 介于 s015 的 ~0.55\n    和 MATH-500 s020 的 0.73 之间，反映 GPQA 的高方差样本特性。\n  tables:\n  - name: Phase-stratified II statistics (GPQA s020)\n    columns:\n    - phase\n    - n_segments\n    - n_tokens\n    - ii_median\n    - ii_mean\n    - ii_ci_low\n    - ii_ci_high\n    rows:\n    - - high\n      - 6261\n      - 479658\n      - 0.038\n      - 0.42\n      - 0.12\n      - 0.95\n    - - mid\n      - 2185\n      - 276409\n      - 0.285\n      - 1.85\n      - 1.42\n      - 2.35\n    - - low\n      - 5128\n      - 465085\n      - 1.98\n      - 12.4\n      - 10.6\n      - 14.5\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: Per-problem paired difference distribution (n=198), showing right-skewed\n    positive distribution with 85%+ problems having positive low-high difference'\n  analysis: Phase gradient 在 s020 显著（Bonferroni-corrected p < 0.001），与 MATH-500 和\n    GSM8K 的 s020 级别定性一致。效应量大于 GSM8K-DS s020 (0.740 median_diff) 但基于 GPQA 更长的推理链和更多\n    segment 采样，统计功效充分。\n- name: GPQA DeepSeek Importance s025\n  plan_id: gpqa_ds_importance_s025\n  description: DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B importance masking at s=0.25 on GPQA-Diamond\n    (n≈198)\n  expected_results:\n    n_problems: 198\n    high_phase_median_ii: 0.095\n    mid_phase_median_ii: 0.72\n    low_phase_median_ii: 3.65\n    median_difference: 3.55\n    median_difference_ci:\n    - 3.05\n    - 4.15\n    wilcoxon_p: 8.2e-34\n    cohens_dz: 0.88\n    gradient_monotonic: true\n    perplexity_high_both: 4.2\n    perplexity_mid_both: 18.5\n    perplexity_low_both: 78.6\n  result_rationale: s025 是 compound interaction 显著增强的关键拐点。在 MATH-500 上 s025 median_diff=3.99，在\n    median 档位下 GPQA 应与 MATH-500 数值相近但略低（~3.55），因为：(1) GPQA 问题推理路径更长但每步 reasoning 深度更浅（多为知识检索+逻辑连接而非深层数学变换），导致\n    per-segment compound interaction 稍弱；(2) GPQA 的 perplexity landscape 更平坦（知识检索 token\n    的 baseline perplexity 较高），discrimination collapse 的相对影响略减。增长因子从 s015→s020 的 2×\n    降至 s020→s025 的 1.8×，符合 sub-exponential 预期。\n  tables:\n  - name: Phase-stratified II statistics (GPQA s025)\n    columns:\n    - phase\n    - n_segments\n    - n_tokens\n    - ii_median\n    - ii_mean\n    - ii_ci_low\n    - ii_ci_high\n    rows:\n    - - high\n      - 6261\n      - 479658\n      - 0.095\n      - 0.88\n      - 0.42\n      - 1.52\n    - - mid\n      - 2185\n      - 276409\n      - 0.72\n      - 5.6\n      - 4.1\n      - 7.8\n    - - low\n      - 5128\n      - 465085\n      - 3.65\n      - 28.5\n      - 22.8\n      - 35.2\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: Dose-response curve comparing GPQA vs MATH-500 vs GSM8K importance median_diff\n    across s015-s025 (3 points), showing parallel monotonic trends with GPQA intermediate\n    between GSM8K and MATH-500'\n  analysis: s025 效应量（d_z≈0.88）进入 large 区间，GPQA gradient 在量级上接近但略低于 MATH-500（3.55 vs\n    3.99），这与 median 档位预期一致——GPQA 的 phase gradient 存在但 specificity magnitude 不如纯数学\n    benchmark。\n- name: GPQA DeepSeek Importance s030\n  plan_id: gpqa_ds_importance_s030\n  description: DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B importance masking at s=0.30 on GPQA-Diamond\n    (n≈198), 关键指标实验\n  expected_results:\n    n_problems: 198\n    high_phase_median_ii: 0.18\n    mid_phase_median_ii: 1.45\n    low_phase_median_ii: 5.05\n    median_difference: 4.87\n    median_difference_ci:\n    - 3.82\n    - 5.95\n    wilcoxon_p: 3.1e-36\n    cohens_dz: 0.95\n    gradient_monotonic: true\n    dose_response_spearman_rho: 1.0\n    perplexity_high_both: 5.8\n    perplexity_mid_both: 32.5\n    perplexity_low_both: 145.2\n    low_high_ratio: 28.1\n  result_rationale: median 档位核心约束：gpqa_imp_median_diff_s030 ∈ [3.0, 6.0]。预测 4.87 落在区间中部。理由：(1)\n    GPQA 推理链长度（~6000 tokens）意味着 low-sparsity phase 有大量 segment 累积 compound damage，但\n    GPQA 问题的 reasoning chain 不如 MATH-500 的逐步推导那样对 intermediate attention pattern 敏感——GPQA\n    更多依赖知识检索和因果推理，而非精确数值操作。(2) 从 s025→s030 增长因子约 1.4×（从 3.55 到 4.87），延续 sub-exponential\n    递减趋势（MATH-500 同区间增长因子 2.1×）。(3) 效应量 d_z≈0.95 接近 MATH-500 的 1.13 但未达到，因 GPQA 的\n    per-problem variance 更高（问题难度跨度大）。(4) 全 4 级 sparsity 构成完美单调序列（rho=1.0），确认 dose-response\n    在 GPQA 上成立。\n  tables:\n  - name: GPQA 4-level dose-response summary\n    columns:\n    - sparsity\n    - median_diff\n    - ci_low\n    - ci_high\n    - cohens_dz\n    - wilcoxon_p\n    rows:\n    - - s015\n      - 0.947\n      - 0.88\n      - 1.03\n      - 0.55\n      - 1.4e-29\n    - - s020\n      - 1.94\n      - 1.72\n      - 2.21\n      - 0.72\n      - 2.5e-28\n    - - s025\n      - 3.55\n      - 3.05\n      - 4.15\n      - 0.88\n      - 8.2e-34\n    - - s030\n      - 4.87\n      - 3.82\n      - 5.95\n      - 0.95\n      - 3.1e-36\n  - name: Cross-benchmark comparison at s030\n    columns:\n    - benchmark\n    - imp_median_diff_s030\n    - growth_factor_s025_s030\n    rows:\n    - - MATH-500\n      - 8.48\n      - 2.13\n    - - GPQA\n      - 4.87\n      - 1.37\n    - - GSM8K\n      - 4.68\n      - 2.35\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: 三 benchmark dose-response 曲线对比（MATH-500 / GPQA / GSM8K），x=sparsity level,\n    y=importance median_diff，显示三者均单调递增但 slope 不同'\n  - 'Fig: GPQA per-problem paired difference 分布 at s030，boxplot + violin，90%+ problems\n    positive'\n  analysis: GPQA s030 median_diff=4.87 确认 phase gradient 跨 benchmark 稳健。值得注意的是 GPQA\n    数值介于 GSM8K(4.68) 和 MATH-500(8.48) 之间，暗示 gradient magnitude 与 reasoning chain complexity\n    非简单线性关系——GPQA 链最长但 gradient 非最大。这可能因为 GPQA 的长链中包含更多'低复杂度'检索 segment，稀释了 per-token\n    compound interaction 的影响。此发现支持 Discussion 中'specificity 与 reasoning depth/type\n    关系'的开放问题。\n- name: GPQA DeepSeek Random s020\n  plan_id: gpqa_ds_random_s020\n  description: DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B random masking at s=0.20 on GPQA-Diamond\n    (n≈198), 用于计算 imp/rand ratio\n  expected_results:\n    n_problems: 198\n    high_phase_median_ii: 0.022\n    mid_phase_median_ii: 0.13\n    low_phase_median_ii: 0.72\n    median_difference: 0.7\n    median_difference_ci:\n    - 0.38\n    - 1.05\n    wilcoxon_p: 0.0035\n    cohens_dz: 0.22\n    gradient_monotonic: true\n    imp_rand_ratio_s020: 2.77\n    perplexity_high_both: 6.2\n    perplexity_mid_both: 8.5\n    perplexity_low_both: 15.8\n  result_rationale: median 档位核心约束：gpqa_imp_rand_ratio ∈ [2.0, 5.0]。预测 ratio=2.77（importance\n    s020 median_diff 1.94 / random s020 median_diff 0.70）。理由：(1) 在 MATH-500 上 DeepSeek\n    random s020 NS（median_diff≈-0.016），但在 LLaMA 上 random 所有条件显著（d_z=0.41-0.46）——GPQA\n    更长的推理链提供更多 statistical power 和更多 low-sparsity segment 让 random masking 的 compound\n    effect 也能积累到可检测水平。(2) GSM8K imp/rand ratio 为 2.3-3.8×，GPQA 在 median 档位应与此一致（因为两者的\n    reasoning chain 长度更接近，都远长于 MATH-500 的短链）。(3) Random 的 phase gradient 存在但效应量小（d_z=0.22,\n    small），与 LLaMA 上观测到的 random gradient 行为一致——进一步确认 strategy specificity 不是 all-or-nothing\n    而是 magnitude difference。(4) 这意味着 reviewers 的质疑成立：GPQA 上 random 也有显著 gradient，只是弱\n    2-3×，需要将'importance-specific'的 framing 改为'importance-dominant but not exclusive'。\n  tables:\n  - name: GPQA Strategy comparison at s020\n    columns:\n    - strategy\n    - median_diff\n    - cohens_dz\n    - p_value\n    - significant\n    rows:\n    - - importance\n      - 1.94\n      - 0.72\n      - 2.5e-28\n      - true\n    - - random\n      - 0.7\n      - 0.22\n      - 0.0035\n      - true\n    - - ratio\n      - 2.77\n      - '-'\n      - '-'\n      - '-'\n  - name: Cross-benchmark imp/rand ratio comparison\n    columns:\n    - benchmark\n    - ratio_range\n    - random_significant_at_s020\n    rows:\n    - - MATH-500 (DS)\n      - 15-17×\n      - No (NS)\n    - - GSM8K (DS)\n      - 2.3-3.8×\n      - Marginal\n    - - GPQA (DS)\n      - 2.5-3.5×\n      - Yes (p<0.005)\n    - - LLaMA cross-arch\n      - 2.0-2.6×\n      - Yes (all conditions)\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: GPQA importance vs random phase gradient 对比 bar chart，显示两者均为正但 importance\n    ~3× 更强'\n  - 'Fig: Strategy specificity ratio 跨 benchmark 汇总图，showing MATH-500 outlier (15-17×)\n    vs GPQA/GSM8K/LLaMA cluster (2-5×)'\n  analysis: GPQA random s020 显著（p<0.005）且 gradient 方向与 importance 一致，但效应量仅为 importance\n    的 1/3。这与 LLaMA cross-arch 结果（ratio 2.0-2.6×）和 GSM8K（2.3-3.8×）高度一致，强化了'MATH-500\n    的 15-17× ratio 是 outlier 而非 norm'的结论。Strategy specificity 成为 established pattern\n    (task-dependent) 而非 isolated anomaly——具体来说，需要短推理链 + 高精度数学计算 + Qwen2 架构才能产生极端 ratio。这要求论文将\n    C1 claim 拆分并加 qualifier：phase gradient universality (strong) vs specificity magnitude\n    (qualified, driven by task×architecture interaction)。\n- name: GPQA Cross-benchmark Gradient Correlation\n  plan_id: gpqa_cross_benchmark_correlation\n  description: 计算 GPQA importance gradient 与 MATH-500/GSM8K gradient 的跨 benchmark\n    相关性\n  expected_results:\n    spearman_rho_gpqa_vs_math500: 1.0\n    spearman_rho_gpqa_vs_gsm8k: 1.0\n    cross_benchmark_gradient_correlation: 0.92\n    gradient_slope_ratio_gpqa_vs_math500: 0.57\n    gradient_slope_ratio_gpqa_vs_gsm8k: 1.04\n  result_rationale: median 档位约束 cross_benchmark_gradient_correlation ∈ [0.85, 0.95]。预测\n    0.92：三个 benchmark 的 4-level dose-response 均为完美单调（Spearman ρ=1.0 each），但 absolute\n    magnitude 和 growth rate 不同。Pearson correlation on log-scale gradient magnitudes\n    给出 0.92（低于 1.0 因为 growth factor 的 benchmark-specific 差异：MATH-500 growth 3.8→4.8→2.1，GPQA\n    growth 2.0→1.8→1.4，GSM8K growth 3.1→2.7→2.4）。这意味着 phase gradient 的定性模式（方向+单调性）完全\n    universal，但定量曲线形状 task-dependent——sufficient for 'phase gradient universality'\n    strong claim，但 slope/curvature 需加 qualifier。\n  tables:\n  - name: 4-level gradient comparison across benchmarks (DeepSeek importance)\n    columns:\n    - sparsity\n    - MATH-500\n    - GPQA\n    - GSM8K\n    rows:\n    - - s015\n      - 0.39\n      - 0.947\n      - 0.241\n    - - s020\n      - 1.21\n      - 1.94\n      - 0.74\n    - - s025\n      - 3.99\n      - 3.55\n      - 1.992\n    - - s030\n      - 8.48\n      - 4.87\n      - 4.682\n  - name: Growth factors between adjacent levels\n    columns:\n    - transition\n    - MATH-500\n    - GPQA\n    - GSM8K\n    rows:\n    - - s015→s020\n      - 3.1×\n      - 2.0×\n      - 3.1×\n    - - s020→s025\n      - 3.3×\n      - 1.8×\n      - 2.7×\n    - - s025→s030\n      - 2.1×\n      - 1.4×\n      - 2.4×\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: Three-panel dose-response with shared y-axis (log scale), showing parallel\n    but non-identical curves; MATH-500 steepest, GPQA flattest at high sparsity'\n  analysis: 跨 benchmark 相关性 0.92 支持 phase gradient universality 的 strong claim。但 GPQA\n    的 sub-exponential decay 明显快于 MATH-500（s025→s030 仅 1.4× vs 2.1×），暗示 GPQA 的 reasoning\n    在 extreme sparsity 下可能已接近 ceiling effect（compound interaction 饱和），而 MATH-500 的精确计算链仍有空间进一步恶化。\n- name: GPQA Strategy Specificity Summary (projected)\n  plan_id: gpqa_strategy_specificity\n  description: 汇总 GPQA 上 importance vs random 的 phase gradient 差异，计算 imp/rand ratio\n    跨 sparsity levels\n  expected_results:\n    imp_rand_ratio_s015: 3.2\n    imp_rand_ratio_s020: 2.8\n    imp_rand_ratio_s025: 3.5\n    imp_rand_ratio_s030: 2.9\n    mean_imp_rand_ratio: 3.1\n    random_significant_fraction: 0.75\n    strategy_x_phase_interaction_p: 0.008\n  result_rationale: median 档位约束 gpqa_imp_rand_ratio ∈ [2.0, 5.0]。预测 mean ratio=3.1，落在区间中下部。理由：(1)\n    GPQA 长推理链给 random masking 更多机会累积 compound effect，缩小与 importance 的差距；(2) ratio\n    跨 sparsity level 相对稳定（2.8-3.5）而非随 sparsity 增大而扩大（这与 MATH-500 不同，后者 ratio 从 s015\n    的 28× 到 s030 的 17× 虽在缩小但始终极端）；(3) random 在多数条件下显著（3/4 significant after Bonferroni），与\n    LLaMA 行为模式一致而非 MATH-500-DeepSeek 的 random-NS 模式。(4) Strategy×phase 交互仍显著（p<0.01）但\n    F 值远小于 MATH-500 的版本，Reviewers 会接受 interaction 存在但要求 magnitude 相关 claims 加 qualifier。\n  tables:\n  - name: GPQA imp/rand ratio by sparsity level\n    columns:\n    - sparsity\n    - imp_median_diff\n    - rand_median_diff\n    - ratio\n    - rand_significant\n    rows:\n    - - s015\n      - 0.947\n      - 0.3\n      - 3.2\n      - marginal (p=0.04)\n    - - s020\n      - 1.94\n      - 0.7\n      - 2.8\n      - yes (p=0.004)\n    - - s025\n      - 3.55\n      - 1.01\n      - 3.5\n      - yes (p<0.001)\n    - - s030\n      - 4.87\n      - 1.68\n      - 2.9\n      - yes (p<0.001)\n  - name: Strategy specificity across all benchmarks\n    columns:\n    - benchmark\n    - mean_ratio\n    - ratio_range\n    - pattern\n    rows:\n    - - MATH-500 (DS n=500)\n      - 22.4\n      - 15.5-38.6×\n      - random NS at s015/s020; extreme separation\n    - - GSM8K (DS n=50)\n      - 2.9\n      - 2.3-3.8×\n      - random gradient exists but weaker\n    - - GPQA (DS n=198)\n      - 3.1\n      - 2.8-3.5×\n      - random mostly significant; moderate separation\n    - - LLaMA cross-arch (n=250)\n      - 2.3\n      - 2.0-2.6×\n      - random all significant; minimal separation\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: Heatmap of imp/rand ratios (rows=benchmark, cols=sparsity), color-coded\n    to show MATH-500 as clear outlier'\n  - 'Fig: Forest plot of strategy×phase interaction effect sizes across benchmarks/architectures'\n  analysis: GPQA ratio 3.1 与 GSM8K (2.9) 和 LLaMA (2.3) 形成 cluster，远离 MATH-500 (22.4)\n    的离群值。这确立了'strategy specificity magnitude is task-dependent'作为 robust pattern 而非\n    isolated observation。Reviewers 会认可 phase gradient universality 但要求将 specificity\n    claim 降调。Discussion 需新增段落分析 possible mechanism：MATH-500 的极端 ratio 可能源于数学计算的 attention\n    pattern 高度结构化（特定 head 专注于操作数关系），使 importance eviction 造成的 discrimination collapse\n    影响远大于 random 的 uniform damage；而 GPQA/GSM8K 的推理更多依赖分布式知识表示，两种 eviction 造成的损伤更均匀。\n- name: Expected Reviewer Scores (median tier)\n  plan_id: reviewer_score_projection\n  description: 基于 GPQA 结果和完整证据链预测 reviewer 评分\n  expected_results:\n    reviewer_1_score: 3.5\n    reviewer_2_score: 3.0\n    reviewer_3_score: 3.5\n    average_score: 3.33\n    novelty_score: 3.25\n    soundness_score: 3.5\n    significance_score: 3.0\n    clarity_score: 3.5\n  result_rationale: median 档位约束 expected_reviewer_avg_score ∈ [3.0, 3.5], novelty_score\n    ∈ [3.0, 3.5]。Reviewer 1（方法论专家）给 3.5：认可 recency control 的 experimental design contribution\n    和 triple dissociation 的清晰性，但对 7B-only scale 有轻微保留。Reviewer 2（efficiency/systems\n    方向）给 3.0：认可 finding 的 empirical rigor 但质疑'so what'——phase gradient 的 practical\n    implication 不够清晰，C5b mitigation pilot 失败削弱了 impact story。Reviewer 3（NLP/reasoning\n    方向）给 3.5：对 cross-benchmark 分析和 task-dependent specificity 的 open question framing\n    表示欣赏，认为这为 future work 打开了有意义的方向。共同关注点：(a) specificity claim 需要 qualifier（全部三人），(b)\n    7B scale limitation（2/3），(c) architecture dependence 需更多讨论（1/3）。\n  tables:\n  - name: Projected reviewer feedback summary\n    columns:\n    - aspect\n    - consensus\n    - dissent\n    rows:\n    - - phase gradient universality\n      - accepted (strong evidence)\n      - none\n    - - strategy specificity magnitude\n      - requires qualifier\n      - R2 wants this demoted to secondary finding\n    - - recency control novelty\n      - recognized as contribution\n      - R2 questions if methodological innovation warrants inclusion\n    - - 7B scale limitation\n      - acknowledged in limitations\n      - R1 suggests at least one 13B+ data point\n    - - architecture dependence\n      - interesting open question\n      - R3 wants more mechanistic speculation\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: Average 3.33 is borderline accept at EMNLP。关键 rebuttal 策略：(1) 强调 phase\n    gradient universality 的 unprecedented evidence breadth (3 benchmarks × 3 architectures\n    × 4 sparsity levels)；(2) 主动承认 specificity is task-dependent 并 frame 为 positive\n    contribution（发现了影响 specificity 的 factors，不是 limitation 而是 nuanced understanding）；(3)\n    对 R2 的 practical impact concern，指向 recency control 作为 future phase-aware system\n    design 的基础。\n","numLines":496,"startLine":1,"totalLines":496}}}
